{"id":"0a75c1a17d157e95","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-thm-pettis.md","title":"Pettis Theorem","display":"thm-pettis — Pettis Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-pettis","aliases":["58-thm-pettis"],"display":"thm-pettis — Pettis Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-weak-measurability.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-measure8-complete-measure-space.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-null-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-pettis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-pettis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pettis — Pettis Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f1f5870a469a5e14\" href=\"?note=f1f5870a469a5e14\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-weak-measurability.md\">../batch09/58-df-weak-measurability.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"689b97c5dc1316d6\" href=\"?note=689b97c5dc1316d6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-measure8-complete-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-measure8-complete-measure-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c740b73b26d2ecf9\" href=\"?note=c740b73b26d2ecf9\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"990e93a33f4633db\" href=\"?note=990e93a33f4633db\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-null-set.md\">../batch11/58-df-null-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu,X,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,X^*,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K},f,s\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu,X,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,X^*,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K},f,s\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8CompleteMeasureSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8CompleteMeasureSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> are the imported exact ambient-space predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NullSet}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{NullSet}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> is the imported measurable-null-set predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^*\">\\(X^*\\)</span> is the continuous dual determined by the displayed Banach-space structure, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K}\">\\(\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K}\\)</span> is the scalar Borel sigma-algebra</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeaklyMeasurable}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{WeaklyMeasurable}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> is the imported exact weak-measurability predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSimple}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSimple}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StronglyMeasurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StronglyMeasurable}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssentiallySeparableRange}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EssentiallySeparableRange}_S\\)</span> are the local typed predicates defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}simple\\text{-}for\\text{-}pettis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VectorSimple}_S(s;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\Omega,X)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\in[X]^{&lt;\\omega}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\;\n(s^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\\in\\mathcal F).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}simple\\text{-}for\\text{-}pettis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VectorSimple}_S(s;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\Omega,X)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\in[X]^{&lt;\\omega}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\;\n(s^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\\in\\mathcal F).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}for\\text{-}pettis}\\vdash\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{StronglyMeasurable}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\Omega,X)\n\\land\\exists\\langle s_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\\;\\exists N\\subseteq\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NullSet}_S(N,\\mu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{VectorSimple}_S(s_n;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}{}\\land\\forall z\\in\\Omega\\setminus N\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\geq n_0\\;\n\\|s_n(z)-f(z)\\|_X&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}for\\text{-}pettis}\\vdash\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{StronglyMeasurable}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\Omega,X)\n\\land\\exists\\langle s_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\\;\\exists N\\subseteq\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NullSet}_S(N,\\mu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{VectorSimple}_S(s_n;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}{}\\land\\forall z\\in\\Omega\\setminus N\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\geq n_0\\;\n\\|s_n(z)-f(z)\\|_X&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}essentially\\text{-}separable\\text{-}range\\text{-}for\\text{-}pettis}\\vdash\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{EssentiallySeparableRange}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\Omega,X)\n\\land\\exists D\\in[X]^{\\leq\\omega}\\;\\exists N\\subseteq\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NullSet}_S(N,\\mu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall z\\in\\Omega\\setminus N\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\|f(z)-d\\|_X&lt;\\varepsilon)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}essentially\\text{-}separable\\text{-}range\\text{-}for\\text{-}pettis}\\vdash\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{EssentiallySeparableRange}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\Omega,X)\n\\land\\exists D\\in[X]^{\\leq\\omega}\\;\\exists N\\subseteq\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NullSet}_S(N,\\mu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall z\\in\\Omega\\setminus N\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\|f(z)-d\\|_X&lt;\\varepsilon)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pettis}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8CompleteMeasureSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\Omega,X)\\\\\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StronglyMeasurable}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}{}\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{WeaklyMeasurable}_S(f,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,X,X^*,\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K})\n\\land\\mathrm{EssentiallySeparableRange}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pettis}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8CompleteMeasureSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\Omega,X)\\\\\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StronglyMeasurable}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}{}\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{WeaklyMeasurable}_S(f,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,X,X^*,\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K})\n\\land\\mathrm{EssentiallySeparableRange}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the Pettis measurability theorem.  The seven arguments of weak measurability now include the continuous dual and scalar Borel sigma-algebra required upstream.</li>\n<li>Strong measurability and essential separability are expanded as almost-everywhere approximation and a countable norm-dense witness, so neither notion remains a prose-only predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-weak-measurability.md","status":"resolved","id":"f1f5870a469a5e14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-weak-measurability.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-measure8-complete-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"689b97c5dc1316d6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-measure8-complete-measure-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"c740b73b26d2ecf9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-null-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"990e93a33f4633db","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-null-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu,X,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,X^*,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K},f,s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8CompleteMeasureSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NullSet}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"X^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeaklyMeasurable}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSimple}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StronglyMeasurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssentiallySeparableRange}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}simple\\text{-}for\\text{-}pettis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VectorSimple}_S(s;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\Omega,X)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\in[X]^{<\\omega}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\;\n(s^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\\in\\mathcal F).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}for\\text{-}pettis}\\vdash\\\\\n&\\quad\\mathrm{StronglyMeasurable}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\qquad\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\Omega,X)\n\\land\\exists\\langle s_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\\;\\exists N\\subseteq\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NullSet}_S(N,\\mu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{VectorSimple}_S(s_n;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,X)\\\\\n&\\hspace{13em}{}\\land\\forall z\\in\\Omega\\setminus N\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\geq n_0\\;\n\\|s_n(z)-f(z)\\|_X<\\varepsilon\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}essentially\\text{-}separable\\text{-}range\\text{-}for\\text{-}pettis}\\vdash\\\\\n&\\quad\\mathrm{EssentiallySeparableRange}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\qquad\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\Omega,X)\n\\land\\exists D\\in[X]^{\\leq\\omega}\\;\\exists N\\subseteq\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NullSet}_S(N,\\mu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall z\\in\\Omega\\setminus N\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\exists d\\in D\\;(\\|f(z)-d\\|_X<\\varepsilon)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pettis}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8CompleteMeasureSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\Omega,X)\\\\\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StronglyMeasurable}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\\\\n&\\hspace{4em}{}\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{WeaklyMeasurable}_S(f,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,X,X^*,\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K})\n\\land\\mathrm{EssentiallySeparableRange}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu,X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3642,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4356","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-thm-pettis.md|58-thm-pettis]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["f1f5870a469a5e14","689b97c5dc1316d6","ef59807ad934771f","c740b73b26d2ecf9","990e93a33f4633db","36d7463d215be751"]}